                        <span className="text-[9px] font-mono font-bold text-rose-500 bg-rose-50 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-rose-100 self-start">未照合：遮断</span>
                        <span className="text-[10px] sm:text-[11px] font-bold text-slate-800">秘密の共通質問に全問正答で開門</span>
